            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the early playtest for Red Filament!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clouds, once safe and friendly, have become misshapen. You volunteered for this assignment with dedication in your heart, but this is not what you expected. There's something whispering from down below, and whatever it is got to the rest of your research team before you arrived.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Phases</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Playable</strong>: Basic gameplay, vibes, and visuals. Major pivots possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Slice</strong>: All major game systems implemented, but very short on content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Closed Alpha</strong>: Supporting systems implemented. Art direction finalized. More content. <strong>&lt;-- We are here!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Closed Beta</strong>: Story finalized. Systems polish. More content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Beta</strong>: Final polish &amp; bugfixing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release</strong>: Everyone gets to play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
